LESSONS LEARNED

remember: golden nagas are spellcasters! (melee range: can destroy armor)
bring to Medusa: /oSt (for statues), "oESP (if not warned, for eels)
chaotic should #pray (and get crowned) for Stormbringer (not #offer)
  ...this is opposite from the usual "#offer for gifts, #pray for books"
Vlad stairs *can* be in Orcus Town, Baalz, etc. levels
hitting disenchanter with a weapon only unenchants it sometimes
  ...engrave 1 letter to unenchant it -1
  ...use +oDrainLife (except with Stormbringer which resists it)
carrying "oY provides occasional spontaneous clairvoyance mapping
wielding the "oY only provides *occasional* warm/hot messages
  ...stumbled onto portal on Water before I found it; no "hot" warning
  ...use the /oSDD (and/or a second c?oGD) much earlier next time


